# ============================================================
# 航班接口测试（GET /api/flights*）
# 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件
# ============================================================

@base = http://localhost:5183/api

### 1. 查询航班列表（不传日期 → 取 fips 最近一天）
GET {{base}}/flights
Accept: application/json

### 2. 查询航班列表（按日期精确过滤，该天无数据自动回退最近天）
GET {{base}}/flights?date=2026-07-31
Accept: application/json

### 3. 查询航班列表（按日期范围过滤）
GET {{base}}/flights?from=2026-07-01&to=2026-07-31
Accept: application/json

### 4. 查询单个航班详情（flights 表）
GET {{base}}/flights/FL-CARGO-001
Accept: application/json

### 5. 新增航班
POST {{base}}/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightNo": "TEST-001",
  "origin": "测试城市",
  "destination": "鄂州",
  "departureTimeUtc": "2026-08-07T01:00:00Z",
  "landingTimeUtc": "2026-08-07T03:00:00Z",
  "flightDate": "2026-08-07",
  "status": "计划",
  "aircraftType": "B737",
  "flightType": "常规航班",
  "category": "货运航班"
}

### 6. 更新航班（局部更新）
PUT {{base}}/flights/TEST-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "起飞"
}

### 7. 删除航班
DELETE {{base}}/flights/TEST-001
Accept: application/json
